zO8sv0spBcEQ7kNvwHWywPr&_nc_oc=AdpI7g2MOHPk1jPtc-7dlfxCY-lXWHrC3OPn0K94d12DLrHrIRObYvDx4FQzbDS4bjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_5EELLR6tOjHLfvB0L6U65ZILlHHRXaVL3urrCwfAlw&oe=69ECCC37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pKfOSHvDkMQQ7kNvwHU_4HV&_nc_oc=AdqlX3UgOH9ztDgsem0gsLCuEF1SWztwZOD22TY7xBDsJK7b-6ZgJomYLKDdroyNh5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1pXvv1jeIjFQBU6370M4PHTTWL4CTMNAOqicvAdi7puw&oe=69ECCDCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pdx4VuotjQoQ7kNvwEHkaeb&_nc_oc=AdqbhEcpsnREEVi5qom_fEZ_vxhjuEoaohOBbCkdz_RW9qB6MU3yFxmEv2RyQEWEUBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0WI1lqnJDvisJ4CmfHebBSX6MJpb056rL3LjiJzXd6Mg&oe=69ECBAEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PodEtCYuLXYQ7kNvwG9B7Aw&_nc_oc=AdqrsQUzmmyD5OGyD3_2YiWxpctewgS3c76LRnlTwjRG3tB74PuUX9eeyejRhFvfUS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0V9pQ-fCTP9Rsjnx8lfBa13fW26dOyn2PnG51JQTbe1Q&oe=69ECA443"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SIqGdBCRmc8Q7kNvwF174Ec&_nc_oc=AdpQDe-99fUc747D5YCODSuhniU50YlOtMLcuIu__4hoNlS0zJzst5crPvVF5STxB3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1I83FibH6_a7MdRH2_mljNzNba4IYhhjtoJ3rsitimNg&oe=69ECD4D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VaGJ4Yl5u4wQ7kNvwGQEXxD&_nc_oc=AdphLifAdAnos1KEQoIIkSKamsxL5xW5lfVIGCxBYDasY7uPDgIFpVwXhp5AkxVkDKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1EFUQXwM1VQvPScp5PFmer4jzCMwJF_V9TGbDJeiDwNQ&oe=69ECAFBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080